    "description": {
      "content": "The Toornament API v2 provides comprehensive esports tournament management capabilities. It includes the Organizer API for full tournament CRUD operations, the Viewer API for public read-only tournament data access, and the Participant API for registration and check-in management. Authentication uses API key plus OAuth2 access tokens with scoped permissions.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Toornament Developer",
